cfg(precise_widens) = true

Hot        rung=  16  carrier=  16  stride=  16  compute_carrier=  16  
Warm       rung=  16  carrier=  16  stride=  16  compute_carrier=  16  
Cold       rung=  16  carrier=  16  stride=  16  compute_carrier=  16  
Cold       rung=  13  carrier=  16  stride=  13  compute_carrier=  16  
Precise    rung=  16  carrier=  16  stride=  16  compute_carrier=  32  <- compute diverges from storage

three associated items on one trait, same arity for every strategy at every
rung, zero feature gates. switching between the two readings of Precise is a
single impl block; nothing else in the mechanism, and nothing in the other
three strategies' impls, needs to move either way.
